public class ArrayUtils {
    public static int[] doubleArray(int[] input) {
        int[] result = new int[input.length];
        for (int i = 0; i < input.length; i++) {
            result[i] = input[i] * 2;
        }
        return result;
    }
}
This method demonstrates array manipulation and returning arrays from methods.

